barev-purple (2.2) unstable; urgency=low

  * fixing contacts file written to haze temp dir instead of ~/.purple:
    haze sets purple_user_dir() to a per-run temp directory that is deleted
    on exit. switching barev_persistent_filename to g_get_home_dir()/.purple
    so the file survives across sessions.
  * fixing bb->conversation not set after auto-learn: barev_auto_learn_buddy
    created the buddy but did not attach the incoming bconv to bb->conversation,
    so barev_send_current_presence_to_buddy failed with "no active conversation".
    now setting bb->conversation = bconv and removing bconv from pending
    conversations after a successful auto-learn.

 -- Norayr Chilingarian <norayr@arnet.am>  Wed, 08 Jul 2026 00:30:00 +0000

barev-purple (2.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * adding auto-learn of contacts from incoming streams: when stream_started
    fires with no matching roster entry but a from-jid is present in the
    stream header, barev_auto_learn_buddy creates a buddy entry for the peer,
    clears no_save, and immediately writes the contacts file. the connection
    then continues on the normal ping+presence path. this bootstraps the case
    where create_roster ran before the user added any eds contacts, so
    barev_add_buddy was never called and the contacts file was never created.

 -- Norayr Chilingarian <norayr@arnet.am>  Tue, 07 Jul 2026 23:30:00 +0000

barev-purple (2.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * fixing incoming connections from hostname-format buddies being rejected:
    when create_roster runs barev_add_buddy("inky@lovelace"), the buddy has
    no known ips yet. conv_match_by_name found the buddy via localpart match
    but validate_ip_consistency then extracted "lovelace" as the expected ip
    and rejected the real yggdrasil peer address, closing the connection and
    preventing ip learning. skipping ip validation when bb->ips is empty and
    the jid's host part is not a valid ipv6 address (it is a hostname). the
    ip is learned from the accepted connection, written to the blist node, and
    immediately saved to the contacts file so it survives unclean shutdowns.

 -- Norayr Chilingarian <norayr@arnet.am>  Tue, 07 Jul 2026 22:00:00 +0000

barev-purple (1.9) unstable; urgency=low

  * fixing purple_connection_set_state called before loading persistent
    contacts: haze's connected_cb fired set_list_received with an empty blist,
    making the initial telepathy contact list empty even when the persistent
    contacts file had entries. moved the connected state signal to after all
    contact loading so the full roster is visible to haze from the start.

